y completing the square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}^{2}+3{y}^{2}-20x+6y+47 & =0 \\\\ 2{x}^{2}+3(0)^{2}-20x+6(0)+47 & =0 \\\\ 2{x}^{2}-20x+47 & =0 \\\\ 2[{x}^{2}-10x]+47 & =0 \\\\ 2[(x-5)^{2}-25]+47 & =0 \\\\ 2(x-5)^{2}-50+47 & =0 \\\\ 2(x-5)^{2} & =3 \\\\ (x-5)^{2} & =\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ x-5 & =\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\ x & =5\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{3}{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the ellipse intercepts the $x$-axis at $(5-\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{2}},0)$ and $(5+\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{2}},0).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403600 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403601 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403600 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403602 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403600 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403603 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403600 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403604 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403600 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403605 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403600 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403600 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403600 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186403601 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403600 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "629087fb-db7f-51a8-827b-0862fb389bb9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403601 #edb/ref 1080 "(5\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{3}{2}},0)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403601 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403601 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ef8edbea-4da2-562c-be95-1803e0e50af8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403602 #edb/ref 1080 "(10\\pm \\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2},0)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403602 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403602 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e45d242e-ec58-51d9-b98e-0c301509d596" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403603 #edb/ref 1080 "There is no $x$-intercept" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403603 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186403603 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9141967a-e95f-5916-97f3-21b